{"id": "AN01", "group": "rig_reach_a", "axis": "asset", "split": "dev", "dimension": "motion", "hard": true, "input": "获准使用的模板 A，绑定姿势、体型、左右标定、测试镜位和允许夸张的动作段已冻结。", "criterion": "肩、肘、腕的解剖标记落在该角色已批准的关节位置容差内。", "procedure": "用模板绑定姿态在两个已标定视角标记或直接读取独立 3D 标记；按体型尺度计算各标记偏差并报告最差部位。单幅外观或候选骨架自证不足以裁定。", "evidence_required": ["approved_landmarks", "candidate_multiview_landmarks", "view_calibration", "registered_pose"], "evidence_types": {"approved_landmarks": "text", "candidate_multiview_landmarks": "text", "view_calibration": "text", "registered_pose": "image"}}
{"id": "AN02", "group": "rig_reach_a", "axis": "asset", "split": "dev", "dimension": "motion", "hard": true, "input": "获准使用的模板 A，绑定姿势、体型、左右标定、测试镜位和允许夸张的动作段已冻结。", "criterion": "伸手全程每根受检前臂的最大相对长度误差低于冻结上限或等于上限。", "procedure": "用机构冻结的 rest_length 和 length_rel 计算各帧；导出最坏段、时刻和误差。若镜头透视、遮挡或缺帧导致 3D 长度无法重建，记录弃权。", "evidence_required": ["frozen_profile", "trace_source", "measurement_report"], "evidence_types": {"frozen_profile": "text", "trace_source": "text", "measurement_report": "text"}}
{"id": "AN03", "group": "rig_reach_a", "axis": "asset", "split": "dev", "dimension": "motion", "hard": true, "input": "获准使用的模板 A，绑定姿势、体型、左右标定、测试镜位和允许夸张的动作段已冻结。", "criterion": "手腕连接处两侧独立测得的端点间隙未超过该模板上限。", "procedure": "读取父段末端与子段起点分别从各自段取得的位置。核查两路来源；共享关节点的重复拷贝没有独立观测能力。", "evidence_required": ["frozen_profile", "anchor_provenance", "measurement_report"], "evidence_types": {"frozen_profile": "text", "anchor_provenance": "text", "measurement_report": "text"}}
{"id": "AN04", "group": "rig_reach_a", "axis": "asset", "split": "dev", "dimension": "motion", "hard": true, "input": "获准使用的模板 A，绑定姿势、体型、左右标定、测试镜位和允许夸张的动作段已冻结。", "criterion": "屈肘时弯曲方向始终符合冻结的局部铰链轴与容许方向。", "procedure": "用校准的局部坐标求有符号角或检查经标定的双视角；覆盖伸直和回收。仅由两条骨算得的无符号夹角，无法区分正向屈曲和反折。", "evidence_required": ["rig_axes", "local_rotation_trace", "signed_angle_report", "calibrated_elbow_views"], "evidence_types": {"rig_axes": "text", "local_rotation_trace": "text", "signed_angle_report": "text", "calibrated_elbow_views": "video"}}
{"id": "AN05", "group": "rig_reach_a", "axis": "asset", "split": "dev", "dimension": "motion", "hard": false, "input": "获准使用的模板 A，绑定姿势、体型、左右标定、测试镜位和允许夸张的动作段已冻结。", "criterion": "前臂轴向旋转没有超过本角色获准的扭转区间。", "procedure": "锁定骨段轴，将局部四元数符号连续化后分解轴向扭转。逐帧对照冻结区间；只有骨头尾坐标时不得判断轴向扭转。", "evidence_required": ["twist_profile", "local_quaternion_series", "twist_measurement"], "evidence_types": {"twist_profile": "text", "local_quaternion_series": "text", "twist_measurement": "text"}}
{"id": "AN06", "group": "rig_reach_a", "axis": "asset", "split": "dev", "dimension": "visual", "hard": true, "input": "获准使用的模板 A，绑定姿势、体型、左右标定、测试镜位和允许夸张的动作段已冻结。", "criterion": "挥手最大弯折区间的腕口网格保持连接，没有产生可见裂缝。", "procedure": "同时查看无材质连通/蒙皮证据与最终画面，沿腕口逐帧比对。将骨端连接正常但袖口网格破裂设作反例；已批准的衣袖开口不计缺陷。", "evidence_required": ["approved_seam_map", "mesh_or_skin_trace", "wrist_closeup"], "evidence_types": {"approved_seam_map": "image", "mesh_or_skin_trace": "text", "wrist_closeup": "video"}}
{"id": "TM01", "group": "stage_stop_b", "axis": "asset", "split": "dev", "dimension": "motion", "hard": false, "input": "独立模板 B，固定相机、完整动作脚本、源帧率和目标设备时钟。", "criterion": "停留段没有超过规定幅度与持续时间的高频抖动。", "procedure": "使用源时钟消除相机运动，计算指定末端的位移差分和峰值持续时间。预登记采样率、噪声底与动作区间，保留未平滑数据；刻意快速挥手放入单独动作段。", "evidence_required": ["raw_marker_series", "camera_and_noise_profile", "stationary_window", "jitter_measurement"], "evidence_types": {"raw_marker_series": "text", "camera_and_noise_profile": "text", "stationary_window": "text", "jitter_measurement": "text"}}
{"id": "TM02", "group": "stage_stop_b", "axis": "asset", "split": "dev", "dimension": "motion", "hard": false, "input": "独立模板 B，固定相机、完整动作脚本、源帧率和目标设备时钟。", "criterion": "循环切口两侧末端速度差未超出该动作的冻结容差。", "procedure": "在正确时间间隔下计算接缝前后速度向量差，至少重复三个完整循环；位置相同而速度方向突变计入异常。", "evidence_required": ["loop_times", "source_marker_series", "velocity_threshold", "loop_measurement"], "evidence_types": {"loop_times": "text", "source_marker_series": "text", "velocity_threshold": "text", "loop_measurement": "text"}}
{"id": "TM03", "group": "stage_stop_b", "axis": "interaction", "split": "dev", "dimension": "runtime", "hard": true, "input": "独立模板 B，固定相机、完整动作脚本、源帧率和目标设备时钟。", "criterion": "超预算的展示帧间隔未被计为达标的连续播放。", "procedure": "分别记录源动画时钟和设备呈现时钟。冷启动、前后台恢复及稳定播放分组，检查最长坏帧与连续次数；导出 30fps 的规范轨迹不能证明手机屏幕实际流畅。", "evidence_required": ["app_build_and_device", "presentation_timestamps", "frame_budget", "frame_time_report"], "evidence_types": {"app_build_and_device": "text", "presentation_timestamps": "text", "frame_budget": "text", "frame_time_report": "text"}}
{"id": "TM04", "group": "stage_stop_b", "axis": "asset", "split": "dev", "dimension": "motion", "hard": false, "input": "独立模板 B，固定相机、完整动作脚本、源帧率和目标设备时钟。", "criterion": "快速切换“挥手 → 聆听”后，未出现超出动作切换规范的关节弹跳。", "procedure": "在中途切换前后对齐事件与逐帧轨迹，记录动作优先级、过渡时间、角速峰值与实际画面。核对允许的预备、撞击和缓动范围。", "evidence_required": ["action_switch_event", "transition_profile", "matched_pose_series", "transition_video"], "evidence_types": {"action_switch_event": "text", "transition_profile": "text", "matched_pose_series": "text", "transition_video": "video"}}
{"id": "OC01", "group": "occluded_hands_c", "axis": "asset", "split": "holdout", "dimension": "visual", "hard": true, "input": "不同角色 C，有前后景遮挡、手指绑定、衣袖和可接触的窗口。", "criterion": "双手交叉遮挡后出现的左右手与衣袖身份仍对应同一只手臂。", "procedure": "冻结左右饰物标记和前后顺序。分别复核遮挡前、遮挡中、重现后与相邻帧，完全不可见的区段记不可观测，不从缺像推断脱肢。", "evidence_required": ["identity_reference", "crossing_video", "annotated_intervals"], "evidence_types": {"identity_reference": "image", "crossing_video": "video", "annotated_intervals": "text"}}
{"id": "OC02", "group": "occluded_hands_c", "axis": "asset", "split": "holdout", "dimension": "visual", "hard": true, "input": "不同角色 C，有前后景遮挡、手指绑定、衣袖和可接触的窗口。", "criterion": "手指在约定的完全可见关键姿态中没有凭空多出或丢失。", "procedure": "使用模板自己的手指数量，覆盖张开和捏取；按可见指根到指尖追踪。遮挡或风格化并指单列等待复核。", "evidence_required": ["hand_topology_reference", "visibility_annotations", "finger_motion_closeup"], "evidence_types": {"hand_topology_reference": "image", "visibility_annotations": "text", "finger_motion_closeup": "video"}}
{"id": "OC03", "group": "occluded_hands_c", "axis": "asset", "split": "holdout", "dimension": "motion", "hard": false, "input": "不同角色 C，有前后景遮挡、手指绑定、衣袖和可接触的窗口。", "criterion": "手掌贴窗保持时，相对接触点的切向滑动未超过动作规范。", "procedure": "冻结接触开始、解除时间和窗口平面，用同一坐标系计算相对接触锚点的切向最大位移。停留时间与允许滑动动作分别标注。", "evidence_required": ["contact_plane", "contact_marker_series", "contact_tolerance", "contact_measurement"], "evidence_types": {"contact_plane": "text", "contact_marker_series": "text", "contact_tolerance": "text", "contact_measurement": "text"}}
{"id": "OC04", "group": "occluded_hands_c", "axis": "asset", "split": "holdout", "dimension": "visual", "hard": true, "input": "不同角色 C，有前后景遮挡、手指绑定、衣袖和可接触的窗口。", "criterion": "除已批准的接触区间，前臂没有穿入躯干或窗口实体超过约定深度与持续时间。", "procedure": "在同步机位查看最终画面，结合网格/碰撞体及有符号距离复算。二维轮廓重叠可以由透视产生，单凭重叠不可断定穿模。", "evidence_required": ["collision_proxy_profile", "intersection_measurement", "contact_exceptions", "multiview_render"], "evidence_types": {"collision_proxy_profile": "text", "intersection_measurement": "text", "contact_exceptions": "text", "multiview_render": "video"}}
{"id": "OC05", "group": "occluded_hands_c", "axis": "asset", "split": "holdout", "dimension": "visual", "hard": false, "input": "不同角色 C，有前后景遮挡、手指绑定、衣袖和可接触的窗口。", "criterion": "动作极限位的袖口没有超出已批准的轮廓畸变范围。", "procedure": "比较已批准的极限姿态和候选最终渲染，检查塌陷、异常尖刺和扭成细绳。区分骨位置正确与最终蒙皮正确，逐段记录严重度和时刻。", "evidence_required": ["approved_extreme_pose", "skinned_silhouette_video", "art_direction_exceptions"], "evidence_types": {"approved_extreme_pose": "image", "skinned_silhouette_video": "video", "art_direction_exceptions": "text"}}
{"id": "RT01", "group": "retarget_d", "axis": "asset", "split": "holdout", "dimension": "motion", "hard": true, "input": "未参与开发调参的候选角色 D 及已人工认可的动作母片、骨架映射和镜像标志。", "criterion": "动作重定向后，主动抬手的解剖侧与母片标注一致。", "procedure": "固定母片和模型镜像标志、局部轴映射与单位。取开始、最高和结束帧判左右，不以观看者的屏幕左右代替解剖侧。", "evidence_required": ["source_side_annotations", "retarget_mapping", "camera_orientation", "target_gesture_video"], "evidence_types": {"source_side_annotations": "text", "retarget_mapping": "text", "camera_orientation": "text", "target_gesture_video": "video"}}
{"id": "RT02", "group": "retarget_d", "axis": "asset", "split": "holdout", "dimension": "motion", "hard": false, "input": "未参与开发调参的候选角色 D 及已人工认可的动作母片、骨架映射和镜像标志。", "criterion": "角色抬臂过程的肩带与上臂协同运动落在该角色获批的参考范围内。", "procedure": "比对不同抬高手势中的肩带与上臂相对方向曲线，附完整正侧面；是否僵硬或塌肩由两位评审对照参考，不设适用于所有卡通角色的通用肩角。", "evidence_required": ["approved_shoulder_motion", "target_shoulder_motion", "character_specific_bounds"], "evidence_types": {"approved_shoulder_motion": "video", "target_shoulder_motion": "video", "character_specific_bounds": "text"}}
{"id": "RT03", "group": "retarget_d", "axis": "asset", "split": "holdout", "dimension": "motion", "hard": false, "input": "未参与开发调参的候选角色 D 及已人工认可的动作母片、骨架映射和镜像标志。", "criterion": "一次点头的预备、下压、回弹和稳定落在批准的动作时序窗内。", "procedure": "用同一动作事件对齐母片和候选，比较峰值顺序及时间窗；不得将不同步的逐帧差值直接当成姿势错误。", "evidence_required": ["approved_phase_windows", "trigger_clock", "head_trajectory", "timing_measurement"], "evidence_types": {"approved_phase_windows": "text", "trigger_clock": "text", "head_trajectory": "text", "timing_measurement": "text"}}
